## Title: All The Collectibles
## Description: Purchasable leftovers, Crown Store, and Crown Crate collectibles for Collectibles Tracker. Collectibles already sorted onto the store or crate tabs are omitted from All The Unsorted Collectibles.
## Author: @dack_janiels[PC]
## APIVersion: 101051 101052
## Version: 2.2
## AddOnVersion: 2
## DependsOn: CollectiblesTracker>=306020 LibScrollableMenu>=20405

l10n/$(language).lua

CollectiblesTrackerAllTheThingsNamespace.lua
CollectiblesTrackerAllTheThingsCategoryIcons.lua
CollectiblesTrackerAllTheThings.lua
CollectiblesTrackerAllTheThingsCrateSources.lua
CollectiblesTrackerAllTheThingsStoreSources.lua
CollectiblesTrackerAllTheThingsThirdPartyTab.lua
CollectiblesTrackerAllTheThingsCrownCrateFilter.lua

